      "body": "\n<div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:2db6f0b257a58cf26d5fd574c50e1f0bc09f53170e3ffee9571dde0fdbc9378d\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>\n\n</p><div><p><span><b>나라 사슴 키링 <span>（사슴뿔, 금속제）</span></b></span></p><p>\n</p><div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:45b720293f392324d9aa091bd7c37175535417213cceb9591174f8dbadcb3739\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p></p><p>\n</p><div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:9dd718f76784b746056bf908a6c20ca4c0742a55432567f79ad3b6344a8f96bb\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p></p><p> </p><p> </p><p><span>지인들 나눠주려고 샀는데 몇개 남음 </span></p><p> </p><p><span><b><span>​여우가면</span></b></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><b>\n</b></span></p><div><b>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:c2f8b0b79f2d954c104896139f2603473cb5ae935df67290c27c1dfef55b98d2\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</b></div><b><br/></b><p></p><p> </p><p> </p><div><span><b>우사기 우산</b></span></div><div><br/></div><div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:cf27d98f416fbbf07a8f7b8f061ad3e5cfba81796f1d9d08b87666be1d000839\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><br/></div><div><span>25cm 정도 접이식 우산. </span></div><div><span>4개 세트로 되어 있는거 샀는데</span></div><div><span>아빠: 하치와레, 엄마: 치이카와, 쵸로미: 모몽가 </span></div><div><span>고르고 남았어요 ㅋㅋ</span></div><div><br/></div><div><span>오늘까지 신청받고 겹치면 추첨할게요.</span></div></div>\n<p></p>\n",
